flowchart TD
    OPEN[open DB] --> GAP{version gap?}
    GAP -->|none| OK[ready]
    GAP -->|migration exists| RUN[run migration tx]
    RUN --> SUCC{success?}
    SUCC -->|yes| OK
    SUCC -->|sql error| ROLLBACK[rollback -> fail open -> fix+test]
    GAP -->|no path| CRASH[IllegalStateException -> add migration]
    GAP -->|destructive fallback| WIPE[DATA WIPED - forbidden in release]
